{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36986","headline":"淮南送司勳李郎中赴阙 · 罗隐","name":"淮南送司勳李郎中赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中朝品秩重文章，双笔依前赐望郎。\n五夜星辰归帝座，半年樽俎奉梁王。\n南都水煖莲分影，北极天寒雁着行。\n不必恋恩多感激，过淮应合见徵黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}